  "title": "Restrict the worker/assignment path to product_forge scope (project changes use PF pipeline)",
  "body": "Source: user scope decision (2026-10-07) captured on BI-PF-0418.\n\nThe worker/assignment path executes Product Forge's OWN backlog only. Restrict it to `product_forge` scope and\nfail-closed for `project`:\n- `GET /engineering/schedule/next?stage=execute` + the assignment API (`/assignments/*`) reject `scope=project`\n  with a clear error (project changes go through PF's pipeline/agents).\n- `job_manager.claim_next` used for external workers claims `product_forge` only (keep the per-item mechanism).\n- Docs: state the two planes (product-building pipeline vs PF-backlog workers).\n\ndashboard_impact: no UI surface.",
